@startuml
' Status: Implemented
' Verified against:
' - src/portfolio_advisor/history/supplementary_nav.py
' - tests/test_supplementary_nav.py::test_atomic_write_retry_exact_readback_and_no_projection
' - tests/test_supplementary_nav.py::test_legacy_v1_admission_is_readable_but_not_retryable
' - tests/test_supplementary_nav.py::test_exact_retry_rejects_wrong_or_post_write_hash_without_changes
' - tests/test_supplementary_nav.py::test_target_changed_after_authorization_is_rejected_without_changes
' - tests/test_supplementary_nav.py::test_target_baseline_stale_baseline_and_valid_plan_collision
' - tests/test_supplementary_nav.py::test_wrong_authorization_bindings_preflight
title Supplementary NAV validation, admission, inspection, and retries [Implemented]

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Owner-controlled caller" as Owner

box "Repository evidence boundary (cannot authorize execution)" #FFF2CC
collections "Policy, F1 parent, assessment, chart,\ntransport receipt, notice, dependencies" as Evidence
database "Phase E baseline snapshot bytes" as Baseline
end box

box "Restricted supplementary-NAV module" #DDEBF7
participant "plan_supplementary_admission" as Planner
participant "execute_supplementary_admission" as Executor
participant "inspect_restricted_admission" as Inspector
participant "_stored strict record validator" as Stored
end box

box "Operator-controlled target boundary" #E2F0D9
participant "Target filesystem path" as Target
database "Isolated restricted SQLite store\n(not a Phase E store)" as RestrictedStore
end box

note over Owner,Evidence
ExecutionAuthorization is a trust input supplied by owner-controlled code.
Policy/evidence files, previews, matching hashes, and directory discovery cannot grant authority.
end note

== Non-writing plan validation ==
Owner -> Planner: repository root + policy Reference + baseline Reference
Planner -> Evidence: read exact policy bytes and verify SHA-256
Planner -> Planner: require exact schema/identity/version, UTC times, approved direction,\nfixed scope/restrictions, and non-authorizing policy fields
Planner -> Evidence: verify F1 parent bytes + canonical fingerprint
Planner -> Evidence: verify assessment, chart, source inventory, dependencies,\ntransport receipt URL/status/completeness/cutoff and all hashes
Planner -> Planner: require one exact semantic identity group
Planner -> Planner: parse exact positive decimal tokens; select locators 1368..1435;\nrequire 68 increasing unique dates and exact assessment occurrence matches
Planner -> Evidence: verify all 8 July discrepancy links; require replacement_selected=false
Planner -> Baseline: require safe path, no SQLite sidecars, exact hash,\ncomplete rollback-journal SQLite bytes
Planner -> Planner: deserialize same bytes into :memory:; PRAGMA query_only=ON
Planner -> Planner: require Phase E tables, one bound manifest, no prefix rows,\nand retained 249-row 2025-08-29..2026-08-31 baseline
alt any path, hash, JSON, provenance, scope, occurrence, discrepancy, or baseline check fails
    Planner --> Owner: SupplementaryError; no target write
else all checks pass
    Planner --> Owner: immutable AdmissionPlan + fingerprint\npreview says executed=false and cannot export for computation
end

== Explicit admission or retry ==
Owner -> Executor: validated AdmissionPlan + absolute target + ExecutionAuthorization
Executor -> Executor: require exact AdmissionPlan and Authorization types
Executor -> Executor: bind authorization target, plan fingerprint, policy SHA-256,\nand non-empty authorization reference
alt missing/wrong authorization binding
    Executor --> Owner: SupplementaryError before target open
else preflight authorization bindings match
    Executor -> Planner: rerun every plan/provenance validation
    Planner --> Executor: fresh plan
    Executor -> Executor: require fresh plan == supplied plan; target != Phase E baseline;\nsafe absolute non-symlink path; no target WAL/SHM/journal
    alt stale plan, tampered dependency, forbidden target, or sidecar
        Executor --> Owner: SupplementaryError before target open
    else target preflight passes
        Executor -> Target: check existence; hash current bytes if present
        alt target does not exist AND expected_initial_target_sha256 is non-null
            Executor --> Owner: target baseline mismatch
            note right of Target
            Rejection occurs before sqlite3.connect(mode=rwc),
            so invalid hash authorization creates no SQLite file.
            end note
        else target existence/hash shape is admissible for inspection
            Executor -> RestrictedStore: sqlite3.connect(mode=rwc); foreign_keys=ON; BEGIN IMMEDIATE
            note right of RestrictedStore
            Connecting to a nonexistent admissible target may create the filesystem entry.
            DDL and rows are governed by the following SQLite transaction.
            end note
            Executor -> RestrictedStore: read installed schema
            alt non-empty schema differs from exact restricted schema
                Executor -> RestrictedStore: rollback
                Executor --> Owner: reject operational/foreign database
            else exact restricted schema is installed
                Executor -> Stored: validate admission, scope, plan, status, restrictions,\nall 68 observations, all 8 discrepancies, and foreign keys
                alt stored record is legacy schema v1
                    Stored --> Executor: readable record; initial_target_sha256=None; known=false
                    Executor -> RestrictedStore: rollback retry transaction
                    Executor --> Owner: reject retry because original target hash is unknown
                else stored record is current schema v2
                    Stored --> Executor: readable record; stored original target hash is known
                    Executor -> Executor: require authorization_reference == stored reference\nand expected_initial_target_sha256 == stored original pre-write hash
                    note right of Executor
                    The original pre-write hash may legitimately differ from the current
                    post-write store hash. Substituting the current hash is rejected.
                    end note
                    alt authorization reference, original hash, plan, or stored content differs
                        Executor -> RestrictedStore: rollback
                        Executor --> Owner: SupplementaryError; store unchanged
                    else exact v2 retry
                        Executor -> RestrictedStore: rollback read transaction; write nothing
                        Executor --> Owner: original RestrictedAdmission and recorded time
                    end
                else exact schema contains no admission and no partial/orphan rows
                    Stored --> Executor: no stored admission; continue new admission
                end
            else target has no schema
                Executor -> Executor: continue new admission
            end

            opt no stored admission and schema is empty or exact
                Executor -> Executor: require current pre-write file hash (or None)\n== authorization.expected_initial_target_sha256
                alt baseline hash changed after authorization
                    Executor -> RestrictedStore: rollback
                    Executor --> Owner: target baseline mismatch; existing bytes unchanged
                else original target baseline matches
                    opt schema absent
                        Executor -> RestrictedStore: create exact restricted tables + immutability triggers
                    end
                    Executor -> RestrictedStore: insert schema-v2 admission record\nincluding original pre-write target hash + authorization reference
                    Executor -> RestrictedStore: insert 68 restricted observations
                    Executor -> RestrictedStore: insert 8 unadmitted discrepancy comparisons
                    Executor -> Stored: strict readback of complete admission
                    alt insert/readback error
                        Executor -> RestrictedStore: rollback transactional DDL and rows
                        Executor --> Owner: error
                    else complete strict readback
                        Executor -> RestrictedStore: commit
                        Executor --> Owner: RestrictedAdmission(schema_version=2,\ninitial target hash known, evidence-only status)
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
end

== Read-only inspection (never grants retry authority) ==
Owner -> Inspector: AdmissionPlan + content-hashed store Reference
Inspector -> Planner: rerun full plan/provenance validation
Inspector -> Target: require safe path, no sidecars, exact referenced hash,\ncomplete SQLite snapshot bytes
Inspector -> Inspector: deserialize same bytes into :memory:; query_only=ON; require exact schema
Inspector -> Stored: strict stored-content validation
alt exact legacy v1 record
    Stored --> Inspector: schema_version=1; initial_target_sha256=None; known=false
    Inspector --> Owner: readable RestrictedAdmission
else exact current v2 record
    Stored --> Inspector: schema_version=2; original hash value/None; known=true
    Inspector --> Owner: readable RestrictedAdmission
else malformed, tampered, partial, ambiguous, or unsupported version
    Stored --> Inspector: SupplementaryError
    Inspector --> Owner: inspection fails closed
end

note over Inspector,RestrictedStore
Readability never authorizes admission or replay. Restricted records cannot be exported
for computation and are intentionally isolated from the ordinary Phase E projection.
end note

@enduml
